e after its class gains a call method and ineligible after\n  4040\t  deletion. Calls whose arguments change this metadata observe the\n  4041\t  correct source-required lookup time without instance rewrapping.\n  4042\t- **Opaque values:** round-trip foreign objects, functions, strings,\n  4043\t  float64 content, and exact integers unchanged. Assert aliasing and no\n  4044\t  silent rounding/null conversion. Unsupported operations yield\n  4045\t  documented guest errors.\n  4046\t- **References:** absent/incompatible writable-location profiles fail\n  4047\t  before reference acquisition and the body, with no reference-induced\n  4048\t  writeback. Source-required side effects from evaluating arguments still\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
